     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "On-demand webinar"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Gain a broader understanding of past drug use through the analysis of keratinized matrices, which offer a wide detection window and non-invasive collection. This webinar will discuss LC-MS/MS-based methods, highlighting the benefits and necessity of high-sensitivity mass spectrometry for detecting low-level drugs."
