   "section": "media-cards",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "More forensic-related content"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Forensic toxicology"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Whether you need to comprehensively screen for drugs, confirm and quantify them, identify unknown substances or characterize new and emerging drugs, SCIEX has a solution that meets all your most demanding requirements."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications/forensics-testing/forensic-toxicology"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Doping control"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Unveil the truth hidden in doping samples by leveraging SCIEX solutions to confidently detect, identify and quantify trace levels of prohibited substances in biological specimens. Our robust suite of instruments provides the sensitivity, specificity and selectivity required to deliver confident results and keep competition fair."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications/forensics-testing/doping-control"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Homeland security"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Detecting trace levels of seized drugs, chemical warfare agents, explosives or illicit materials requires high throughput and sensitive instrumentation. SCIEX has an extensive portfolio of LC-MS/MS instrumentation that provides the evidence required by the forensic and security communities."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications/forensics-testing/homeland-security"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "Cannabinoid analysis and potency testing"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "The diversity of cannabinoids makes it hard to perform analysis and potency testing accurately. SCIEX provides sensitive, precise instrumentation capable of differentiating synthetic and natural cannabinoids. Forensic labs, where such use is permitted under local state or country law, can now test with the highest confidence."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications/forensics-testing/cannabinoid-analysis-and-potency-testing"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "PFAS biomonitoring"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Accurately quantify and identify PFAS contaminants with SCIEX LC-MS/MS solutions, offering unmatched sensitivity and specificity for both targeted and non-targeted analysis."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications/forensics-testing/pfas-biomonitoring"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "Drug surveillance in wastewater"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "Monitor drug consumption trends with SCIEX LC-MS/MS instruments, providing robust and sensitive analysis of trace levels of drugs and metabolites in wastewater."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications/forensics-testing/drug-surveillance-in-wastewater"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "Environmental contaminant biomonitoring"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "Reliably detect low-level environmental contaminants in various biological matrices using SCIEX LC-MS/MS solutions, ensuring precise and accurate monitoring of pesticides, herbicides and more."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications/forensics-testing/environmental-contaminant-biomonitoring"
    }
   ],
